flowchart TB
accTitle: Durable video processing survives worker interruption
accDescr: Fargate serves the application, S3 holds durable video data, retryable Spot workers normalize jobs, and asynchronous Rekognition results return after completion.
WEB["Web containers on Fargate"] -->|Upload| S3[("S3 video objects")]
WEB -->|Video key| Q[("SQS normalization jobs")]
Q --> W["EC2 Spot worker"]
W -->|Read and checkpoint| S3
W -->|Normalized video key| R["Start Rekognition job"]
R --> C["Completion notification"]
C --> G["Get analysis results"]
W -.->|Interrupted job becomes available again| Q
class WEB inputData
class S3,Q storage
class C inputData
